    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/b2c4f5bf31c5f77af92c35cb268947da.poster.avif?t=1750147686\" width=660 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/b2c4f5bf31c5f77af92c35cb268947da.webm?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/b2c4f5bf31c5f77af92c35cb268947da.mp4?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Ella Stars \u2013 Conquer the stage with the power of rhythm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rhythm? No problem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Ella Stars</i></strong>, Ella and Bird team up to take down villains threatening the world of music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge boss skills to the beat and strike back with rhythm action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A music action game bursting with energy\u2014like it jumped right out of an animation. Join the groove now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/da045e1f067a28a43818aade36981717.poster.avif?t=1750147686\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/da045e1f067a28a43818aade36981717.webm?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/da045e1f067a28a43818aade36981717.mp4?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Thrilling Fever Time!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the beats, land powerful attacks, and defeat your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/c758fdae10daf52b69e5246b1039e7a7.poster.avif?t=1750147686\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/c758fdae10daf52b69e5246b1039e7a7.webm?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/c758fdae10daf52b69e5246b1039e7a7.mp4?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Groggy System to crush the boss!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks and knock bosses into a groggy state! Seize your moment to turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/4494153e88ce936a2efcad0b169b2648.poster.avif?t=1750147686\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/4494153e88ce936a2efcad0b169b2648.webm?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/4494153e88ce936a2efcad0b169b2648.mp4?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Special Costumes &amp; Unique Action Effects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the fun with various themed Ella costumes and stylish action effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.poster.avif?t=1750147686\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.webm?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.mp4?t=1750147686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
